Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{100%}} damage;

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{<1% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}} and boosts rage recovery by {{<0.5% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}}; lasts {{2}} turns, can stack up to {{2}} times. Stacking does not refresh the duration. Cannot be dispelled.

Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{102.5%}} damage;

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{<2% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}} and boosts rage recovery by {{<1% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}}; lasts {{2}} turns, can stack up to {{2}} times. Stacking does not refresh the duration. Cannot be dispelled.

Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{105%}} damage;

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{<3% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}} and boosts rage recovery by {{<1.5% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}}; lasts {{2}} turns, can stack up to {{2}} times. Stacking does not refresh the duration. Cannot be dispelled.

Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{107.5%}} damage; deals additional damage equal to {{2%}} of the target's max HP (up to {{30%}} of Wildspirit Hound's attack). For each instance of [Wild God's Assault] damage in {{1}} turn, the damage coefficient of the next [Wild God's Assault] increases by {{107.5%}};

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{4% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks}}, boosts rage recovery speed by {{2% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks}}; the effect holder gains {{1}} stack of [Wild God's Fury] each time they take damage. The effect lasts {{2}} turns and can stack up to {{5}} times. Stacking does not refresh the duration, and it cannot be dispelled.

Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{110%}} damage; deals additional damage equal to {{3%}} of the target's max HP (up to {{30%}} of Wildspirit Hound's attack). For each instance of [Wild God's Assault] damage in {{1}} turn, the damage coefficient of the next [Wild God's Assault] increases by {{110%}}.

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{6% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks}}, boosts rage recovery speed by {{3% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks}}; the holder gains 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] each time they take damage. [Wild God's Fury] can stack up to {{5}} times and lasts for {{2}} turns (adding stacks does not refresh the duration). Cannot be dispelled.

Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{115%}} damage; deals additional damage equal to {{4%}} of the target's max HP (up to {{30%}} of Wildspirit Hound's attack). For each instance of [Wild God's Assault] damage in {{1}} turn, the damage coefficient of the next [Wild God's Assault] increases by {{115%}}.

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{8% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks}}, boosts rage recovery speed by {{4% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks}}; the effect holder gains {{1}} stack of [Wild God's Fury] each time they take damage. The effect lasts {{2}} turns and can stack up to {{5}} times. Stacking does not refresh the duration, and it cannot be dispelled.

Randomly apply 1 stack of [Wild God's Fury] to {{3}} allied heroes, then unleash [Wild God's Assault] {{times equal to the number of enemy heroes + the number of allied heroes with [Wild God's Fury]}};

[Wild God's Assault]: Attacks a single enemy, dealing {{120%}} damage; deals additional damage equal to {{5%}} of the target's max HP (up to {{30%}} of Wildspirit Hound's attack). For each instance of [Wild God's Assault] damage in {{1}} turn, the damage coefficient of the next [Wild God's Assault] increases by {{120%}}.

[Wild God's Fury]: Increases damage dealt by {{<10% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}} and boosts rage recovery speed by {{<5% * number of [Wild God's Fury] stacks>}}; each time the effect holder uses a Normal Attack, Skill, or Ultimate/Super Ultimate, it deals {{100%}} of the damage to {{1}} random target around the main target (up, down, left, or right). Each time the effect holder takes damage, they gain {{1}} stack of [Wild God's Fury]. When [Wild God's Fury] ends, Wildspirit Hound immediately releases {{2}} instances of [Wild God's Fury] on {{1}} random enemy hero. The effect lasts {{2}} turns and can stack up to {{5}} times. Stacking does not refresh the duration, and it cannot be dispelled.

sub.text:
At the start of each round, attacks a column of enemies, dealing {{240%}} DMG to the front-row hero and applying {{1}} stack of [Bone Fracture].
Applies {{2}} stacks of [Bone Fracture] to the back-row enemy hero and deals Bone Fracture stacks * {{240%}} DMG (minimum {{240%}} DMG).

If the target column has only {{1}} enemy hero, applies {{3}} stacks of [Bone Fracture] to the target and deals Bone Fracture stacks *{{240%}} DMG to the target (minimum {{240%}} DMG).

[Bone Fracture]: Reduces the holder's Skill DMG Bonus and Crit DMG RES by Bone Fracture stacks * {{10%}}; nullifies the holder's incoming HP recovery, and for every {{10%}} of the holder's Max HP worth of recovery nullified, dispels {{1}} stack of [Bone Fracture];

Before the holder releases a Basic Attack, Skill, or Follow-up Attack, each target has a {{50%}} chance to have the DMG of this attack reduced by {{60%}};
Effect lasts for the entire battle, can stack up to {{3}} stacks, and cannot be dispelled by effects other than this effect.
